{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28064","headline":"与诸公池上待月 · 杨发","name":"与诸公池上待月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树密云萦岸，池遥水际空。\n芰开方吐镜，苹动欲含风。\n渐映沙汀白，微分渚叶红。\n金波宜共赏，仙櫂一宵同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}